  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/d6e0a8f200546ab339f8f6ca25d199f0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"524\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ZyNGZr4E2u\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/879788820265074698?color=F7F3F5&amp;labelColor=030B14&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;label=Discord&amp;logoColor=ff96c5\" alt=\"\" width=\"194\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/cojalexandru/pickable-orbs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/PICKABLEORBS-GitHub?color=F7F3F5&amp;labelColor=030B14&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=GitHub&amp;label=GitHub&amp;logoColor=ff96c5\" alt=\"\" width=\"214\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdecursio-team-1.gitbook.io%252fwiki%252fmods%252fpickable-health-orbs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Wiki-PickableOrbs-F7F3F5?labelColor=030B14&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"28\"></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/5b267057e5289aa3818c50860385b947.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1044\" height=\"58\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">模組概覽</span></strong></em></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;我們<strong>Decursio團隊</strong>今日要向您展示我們的首批模組之一——<strong><em>可拾取生命寶珠！</em></strong>&nbsp;這是一款RPG風格模組，添加了可由特定生物/方塊掉落的寶珠。拾取這些寶珠將提供特定增益效果，例如即時治療與其他藥水效果。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">如果您是模組包開發者，您可能會樂於聽到：與其他模組不同，本模組使用實體來創建這些寶珠。這意味著玩家將無法拾取寶珠並留待後用的情況。但如果您確實需要前述功能，請知悉從未來某版本開始，將可實現拾取並儲存寶珠以供後用的功能。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/5b267057e5289aa3818c50860385b947.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1044\" height=\"58\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">功能特色</span></strong></em></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">本模組<em><strong>高度可自訂</strong></em>。您可透過模組配置檔案新增/移除任意寶珠。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此外，您可自訂每種寶珠的掉落機率、掉落生物、效果持續時間、效果強度等參數。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">預設情況下，本模組包含8種可拾取寶珠：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- <em><strong>治療寶珠：</strong></em>拾取時按固定值治療玩家（數值可配置）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">-&nbsp; <em><strong>劇毒寶珠：</strong></em>預設施加5秒中毒效果</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- <em><strong>傷害寶珠：</strong></em>基於原版「瞬間傷害」效果，造成兩顆心傷害</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- <strong><em>跳躍寶珠：</em></strong>預設提供5秒跳躍提升效果</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- <strong><em>迅捷寶珠：</em></strong>提供5秒速度效果</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- <strong><em>迷惑寶珠：</em></strong>施加5秒失明效果</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- <strong><em>飄浮寶珠：</em></strong>使玩家飄浮5秒</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- <strong><em>抗火寶珠：</em></strong>提供5秒火焰抗性</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">所有數值均可透過模組配置檔案調整，檔案位置：<strong><em>instance/config/pickableorbs/orbs</em></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/5b267057e5289aa3818c50860385b947.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1044\" height=\"58\"></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>圖片展示</strong></span></em></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/441/145/1lbkvw9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"627\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/441/146/gj0zlc8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"627\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/441/147/2022-03-17_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"628\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/441/148/2022-03-17_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"627\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/441/149/2022-03-17_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"628\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/5b267057e5289aa3818c50860385b947.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1044\" height=\"58\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em><strong>其他專案</strong></em></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Decursio企劃：專家版</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">受Sevtech:Ages與Enigmatica 2:Expert啟發的專家級模組包</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/decursio-project\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/DecursioProject/BH_DP_Header.png\" width=\"1041\" height=\"347\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>簡易木製盔甲</strong></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">重現早期模組包中木製盔甲的簡易模組</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-wooden-armor\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/050a47c2de15f4f1c9f55c40eccc15da.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"511\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>血魄兵武</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">為<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eidolon#:~:text=Eidolon is a magic mod,around necromancy and soul manipulation.\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eidolon</a></strong>模組的擴充，專注於戰鬥與風格化功能</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sanguine-arsenal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/71e0748d7cae56fc661bc49f48570b03.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"511\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/remastered-projecte\" rel=\"nofollow\">ProjectE重製軍械庫</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">為ProjectE盔甲添加新模型的裝飾性模組</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/5b267057e5289aa3818c50860385b947.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1044\" height=\"58\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><em>短片展示</em></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組曾於<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pwrdownyt/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">PwrDown</a>的近期<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYyRRWyMLSMCfKiIvfWYvkw\" rel=\"nofollow\">YouTube影片</a>中亮相。可拾取生命寶珠展示於8分10秒處。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/926tcazSPNY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
